<%args>
</%args>

<div class="modal fade" id="upload_pedigrees_validate_display" name="upload_pedigrees_validate_display" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="uploadPedigreesValidateDialog">
  <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button>
        <h4 class="modal-title" id="uploadPedigreesValidateDialog">驗證結果(Results From Validation)</h4>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="container-fluid">
            <div class="well">若種原已存在父本或母本時覆寫親本：<input type="checkbox" checked id="pedigree_upload_overwrite_pedigrees" /></div>
 	  <table class="table table-hover">
    	    <tbody></tbody>
  	  </table>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal">關閉(Close)</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" name="upload_pedigrees_store" id="upload_pedigrees_store" data-dismiss="modal">儲存(Store)</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


<div class="modal fade" id="pedigrees_upload_success_dialog_message" name="pedigrees_upload_success_dialog_message" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="uploadPedigreesSuccessDialog">
  <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button>
        <h4 class="modal-title" id="uploadPedigreesSuccessDialog">上傳成功(Upload Successful)</h4>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="container-fluid">
 	  <h2>譜系上傳已完成，無任何錯誤。</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" id="pedigrees_upload_success_dismiss" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal">關閉(Close)</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


<div class="modal fade" id="upload_pedigrees_dialog" name="upload_pedigrees_dialog" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="uploadPedigreesDialog">
  <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button>
        <h4 class="modal-title" id="uploadPedigreesDialog">上傳譜系(Upload Pedigrees)</h4>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="container-fluid">
    	  <&| /page/explanation.mas, title=>'範本資訊(Template Information)' &>
    	  <p>
      	  <b>檔案格式資訊</b>
      	  <br>
      	  <a id="pedigrees_upload_spreadsheet_format_info">試算表格式(Spreadsheet Format)</a>
    	  </p>
  	  </&>

  	  <form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" encoding="multipart/form-data" id="upload_pedigrees_form" name="upload_pedigrees_form">
    	    <label for="pedigrees_uploaded_file" style="display: inline-block; width: 100px;">上傳譜系檔案：</label>
    	    <input type="file" name="pedigrees_uploaded_file" id="pedigrees_uploaded_file" encoding="multipart/form-data" />
  	  </form>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal">關閉(Close)</button>
	<button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" name="upload_pedigrees_dialog_submit" id="upload_pedigrees_dialog_submit">驗證(Validate)</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="modal fade" id="pedigrees_upload_spreadsheet_info_dialog" name="pedigrees_upload_spreadsheet_info_dialog" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="pedigreeUploadInfoDialog">
  <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button>
        <h4 class="modal-title" id="pedigreeUploadInfoDialog">範本資訊(Template Information)</h4>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="container-fluid">
 	  <b>譜系可以 Tab 分隔的文字檔格式上傳</b>
	  <br>
	  <p>（<b>不支援</b> .xls 或 .xlsx 格式）</p>
	  <hr>
	  <b>表頭：</b>
	  <br>
	  <p>第一列（表頭）應包含以下內容：</p>

	  <table class="table table-hover table-bordered">
  	  <body>
	    <tr>
    	      <td>後裔名稱(progeny name)</td>
    	      <td>母本種原(female parent accession)</td>
    	      <!--<td>male parent accession(s) (if more than one, separate using commas)</td>-->
              <td>父本種原(male parent accession)</td>
              <td>類型(type)</td>

  	    </tr>
	  </body>
	  </table>

	  <h4>必填欄位：</h4>
	  <ul>
        <li>後裔名稱（progeny name，必須存在於資料庫中，可以是種原唯一名稱或種原別名）</li>
        <li>母本種原（female parent accession，必須存在於資料庫中）</li>
        <li>類型（type：biparental, self, open, backcross, sib, polycross, reselected）</li>
            <ul class="a">
                <li>雜交類型說明：</li>
                <ul class="b">
                    <li>biparental：單一植株由另一單一植株授粉。</li>
                    <li>self：自花授粉的單一植株。</li>
                    <li>open：單一植株由一組植株授粉或開放授粉（花粉可能來自成員已知或未知的群體）。</li>
                    <li>backcross：單一植株與其親本之一回交授粉。</li>
                    <li>sib：至少具有一個共同親本的個體之間的交配。通常是在同一小區內的兩個個體之間。</li>
                    <li>polycross：來自一個族群的單一母本個體與相應的父本族群之間的交配。</li>
                    <li>reselected：從現有品系中選育出新種原（例如由突變引起）。</li>
                </ul>
            </ul>
      </ul>

	  <h4>選填欄位</h4>
	  <ul>
	    <!--li>male parent accession (if provided, must exist in the database). Several potential male parents can be given separated by commas. A population entry will be generated in that case, with the listed male parents associated to the population.</li-->
        <li>父本種原（male parent accession，可以是種原唯一名稱、種原別名或族群名稱）。</li>
	  </ul>

	  <h4>注意事項</h4>
	  <ul>
	    <li>請務必指定雜交類型（biparental, self, open, sib, backcross, polycross 或 reselected）。</li>
	    <li>如果類型為 open 且無已知的潛在父本，請將父本欄位留空。</li>
	  </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal">關閉(Close)</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
